  "body": "## Goal\nAdd a deterministic headless regression check for the actual no-unit tutorial battle path.\n\n## Background\nThe live Hera capture reached tutorial wave 4 with the battle still correctly resolving objective/base combat. A real-time wait is not a practical proof of the final state. The product must retain the real combat outcome path; scripted tutorial victory is forbidden.\n\n## Scope\n- Start the existing tutorial without deployed rewards.\n- Advance the existing StageRun/BattleSimulator through its real wave, gate, and base-destruction rules.\n- Assert all four declared waves emit, the result is real defeat, and the command phase becomes REVIEW.\n- Record machine-evidence boundaries without claiming human usability or a live HERA REVIEW capture.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- The headless test passes on Godot 4.7.1.\n- Existing documentation and Notion Home distinguish headless natural-result PASS from live/human evidence still NOT_RUN.\n- No gameplay balance or victory-rule changes.",
